    <node id="Fictional Reference World">
      <data key="d0">Fictional Reference World</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Fictional Reference World is an imagined, conceptual setting that serves as the backdrop for registry entries and their relationships. It functions as a constructed reference frame within which subregions, registry entries, and their interconnections are defined, providing a consistent context for describing and organizing the registry’s contents. This hypothetical or illustrative setting is employed for fictional references, allowing registry entries to be situated in a coherent, yet purely conceptual, environment. The world is described as a conceptual setting that exists solely within the registry context, referred to as the current fictional reference world, and is used to contextualize the registry entries and their relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;A fictional world referenced by the registry entry.&lt;SEP&gt;An imagined setting referenced within the registry entry.&lt;SEP&gt;A constructed world used for reference purposes in the registry.&lt;SEP&gt;A conceptual world used for illustrative purposes in the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">D012c0031b1c2d5f5b85e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D05bcb6c31f6fea61f984-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D112f091f348d72661fce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D32fee42740fc2d3298a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D340ca21d12f63d1cd917-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3bf755801edbd55b30c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3ef4f03e9b791e37b6ba-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D426cb2030d97ab194aad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6bc36a09c6ec8f5132fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D76413fefe6657c0277f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D79e87d2f4d1f958bca1f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D87e6c533b79da8158b89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D92b87fb4dd790a9a0f2f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9f759ab27061c634112b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4dcda9f1198705b8e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dbb866ffea43863d04da8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc91305e56ad8347c54e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1960a17d8787a3b1cee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De3f35bb5cd2daf23678e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Decdf71c98e5febd35406-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Df08f83e6fbc691cf3e31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dfa1b226b2a08def00dc8-chunk-000</data>
