    <node id="Source Assertion">
      <data key="d0">Source Assertion</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Source Assertion

A Source Assertion is a statement recorded by a registry entry that serves as the source of information. It is a conceptual assertion documented within the registry entry itself and is not evaluated against other registry entries or entries. The assertion stands alone, providing a reference point for the information it conveys without comparison or validation against additional data. It is an assertion recorded by the registry entry that is not evaluated against other entries, and it serves as the source of information without evaluation of other entries. The assertion recorded by the registry entry is recorded as the source in the registry entry.&lt;SEP&gt;An assertion that originates from a source without evaluation of other entries.&lt;SEP&gt;A statement asserting a source without evaluating other entries.</data>
      <data key="d3">D012c0031b1c2d5f5b85e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D05bcb6c31f6fea61f984-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D112f091f348d72661fce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D1759848a15f03afde86d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D25fbde5780c9df0a16a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D307f61e2bb61c65dbffa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D32fee42740fc2d3298a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D340ca21d12f63d1cd917-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3bf755801edbd55b30c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3ef4f03e9b791e37b6ba-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D426cb2030d97ab194aad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6bc36a09c6ec8f5132fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D76413fefe6657c0277f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D79e87d2f4d1f958bca1f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D813a5727276cc4bd97d1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D92b87fb4dd790a9a0f2f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9c01ceca580f57a3a888-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9f759ab27061c634112b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4656d39a9d08594c964-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4dcda9f1198705b8e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dbb866ffea43863d04da8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc91305e56ad8347c54e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc9320332e07435936dd6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1960a17d8787a3b1cee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Ddc7a70b23d3d5d8f9979-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Decdf71c98e5febd35406-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Df08f83e6fbc691cf3e31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dfa1b226b2a08def00dc8-chunk-000</data>
