    <node id="Current Fictional Reference World">
      <data key="d0">Current Fictional Reference World</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Current Fictional Reference World is a conceptual setting that provides the backdrop for all registry entries and their associated relationships. It serves as the overarching fictional context in which each entry, subregion, and region is situated. Within this world, the registry entries are described and contextualized, establishing the relationships and hierarchies that exist among the various elements. The world itself is referenced as a specific instance in the text, underscoring its role as the foundational environment for the registry’s content.&lt;SEP&gt;The fictional world context in which the registry entry and its relationships exist.&lt;SEP&gt;The contextual setting in which the registry entry and source assertion are described.&lt;SEP&gt;An abstract setting referred to as the current fictional reference world within the registry context.&lt;SEP&gt;The fictional world context in which the registry entry describes a relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;A fictional world referenced in the registry entry.&lt;SEP&gt;The fictional world context in which the registry entry and its described relationship exist.</data>
      <data key="d3">D1759848a15f03afde86d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D25fbde5780c9df0a16a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D307f61e2bb61c65dbffa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D69ab7fa586361d0bba4c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D813a5727276cc4bd97d1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9c01ceca580f57a3a888-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4656d39a9d08594c964-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4dcda9f1198705b8e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc9320332e07435936dd6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Ddc7a70b23d3d5d8f9979-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De4e2983cbee815e6065b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">D1759848a15f03afde86d.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D25fbde5780c9df0a16a1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D307f61e2bb61c65dbffa.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D69ab7fa586361d0bba4c.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D813a5727276cc4bd97d1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D9c01ceca580f57a3a888.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Db4656d39a9d08594c964.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Db4dcda9f1198705b8e51.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Dc9320332e07435936dd6.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Ddc7a70b23d3d5d8f9979.txt&lt;SEP&gt;De4e2983cbee815e6065b.txt&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf.txt&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f.txt</data>
