    <edge source="Registry Entry" target="Fictional Reference World">
      <data key="d7">13.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation named **(Fictional Reference World, Registry Entry)** refers to a registry entry that is situated within and describes the fictional reference world. The entry records and describes the stated relationship that exists in the current fictional reference world, indicating that it is both located inside that world and provides information about the relationships within it.&lt;SEP&gt;Registry Entry is situated within the Fictional Reference World.&lt;SEP&gt;The registry entry describes the stated relationship in the fictional reference world.</data>
      <data key="d9">context of,describes,describes in,describes_in,exists in,located in,occurs in</data>
      <data key="d10">D012c0031b1c2d5f5b85e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D112f091f348d72661fce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D32fee42740fc2d3298a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3ef4f03e9b791e37b6ba-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D79e87d2f4d1f958bca1f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9f759ab27061c634112b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De3f35bb5cd2daf23678e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Decdf71c98e5febd35406-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dfa1b226b2a08def00dc8-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">D012c0031b1c2d5f5b85e.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D112f091f348d72661fce.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D32fee42740fc2d3298a6.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D3ef4f03e9b791e37b6ba.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D79e87d2f4d1f958bca1f.txt&lt;SEP&gt;D9f759ab27061c634112b.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662.txt&lt;SEP&gt;De3f35bb5cd2daf23678e.txt&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Decdf71c98e5febd35406.txt&lt;SEP&gt;Dfa1b226b2a08def00dc8.txt</data>
      <data key="d12">1795372973</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Registry Entry" target="Source Assertion">
      <data key="d7">28.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation (Registry Entry, Source Assertion) specifies that a registry entry serves as a container for a source assertion. In this relationship, the registry entry records or holds the source assertion, and this act of recording is performed independently of any evaluation of other registry entries. The source assertion is thus contained within the registry entry, which records it without assessing additional entries.&lt;SEP&gt;The registry entry records a source assertion without evaluating other registry entries.&lt;SEP&gt;Registry Entry records the source assertion.&lt;SEP&gt;Registry Entry records the Source Assertion.&lt;SEP&gt;The registry entry records a source assertion.</data>
      <data key="d9">assertion,asserts,contained_in,contains,describes,originates from,recording,records</data>
      <data key="d10">D012c0031b1c2d5f5b85e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D05bcb6c31f6fea61f984-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D112f091f348d72661fce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D1759848a15f03afde86d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D25fbde5780c9df0a16a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D307f61e2bb61c65dbffa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D32fee42740fc2d3298a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3bf755801edbd55b30c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3ef4f03e9b791e37b6ba-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6bc36a09c6ec8f5132fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D76413fefe6657c0277f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D79e87d2f4d1f958bca1f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D813a5727276cc4bd97d1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D92b87fb4dd790a9a0f2f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9c01ceca580f57a3a888-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9f759ab27061c634112b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4656d39a9d08594c964-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4dcda9f1198705b8e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dbb866ffea43863d04da8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc9320332e07435936dd6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Decdf71c98e5febd35406-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dfa1b226b2a08def00dc8-chunk-000</data>
