    <edge source="Registry Entry" target="Current Fictional Reference World">
      <data key="d7">11.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The **Registry Entry** is a construct that exists within the **Current Fictional Reference World**. It serves to describe and document the relationships that occur in that world, providing a structured account of how entities interact and are situated within the setting. The entry also offers a description of the world’s setting itself, thereby contextualizing the relationships it records. In essence, the Registry Entry functions as a comprehensive reference point that both locates itself within the fictional world and supplies detailed information about the world’s relational dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;The registry entry describes the stated relationship in the current fictional reference world.&lt;SEP&gt;The registry entry records that the current fictional reference world is part of the described relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;Registry Entry describes the relationship within the current fictional reference world.</data>
      <data key="d9">context,contextualizes,describes,describes in,describes_in,located in,occurs_in,references</data>
      <data key="d10">D1759848a15f03afde86d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D25fbde5780c9df0a16a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D307f61e2bb61c65dbffa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D69ab7fa586361d0bba4c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9c01ceca580f57a3a888-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4656d39a9d08594c964-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db4dcda9f1198705b8e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc9320332e07435936dd6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000</data>
